  "details": "Please take a look at this video.\nhttps://youtu.be/sI69NBIbU90\n\nAs demonstrated in the video above, when the outline is rendering, there is an impact on fps, at least in my setup.\n\nI believe it was first introduced in these patch releases, I don't know exactly which one, this didn't happen before these recent updates.\n\nI noticed this in 2019.2.1p3 and proceeded in recording the video above.\nThis post was created here to help tracking the issue as requested by support mail response.\n\nThe world: wrld_f65d2484-c354-465a-841f-5e2fc6318030\nCPU: Intel Core i3 6100\nGPU: AMD Radeon R5 310\n\nThis might not happen in newer hardware.\nThough as mentioned above, this problem didn't happen before, at least I didn't notice before.",
